# What the demos and the Makefile here build, in place. A program has no
# extension: every extensionless file is ignored, every file with one is
# kept (sources, scripts). Makefile is kept by name, and the products that
# do have an extension are ignored again.
*
!*/
!*.*
!Makefile
*.o
*.i
*.s
*.exe
a.out
__pycache__/
